## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-08. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### EXP Lane Standard (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, War Axe, Hunter Strike, Malefic Roar, Queen's Wings, Blade of the Heptaseas
- Core: War Axe, Hunter Strike, Malefic Roar
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Master Assassin, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Petrify
- Flex: Blade of Despair over Blade of the Heptaseas when Swap to Blade of Despair when you are snowballing and need the late-game one-shot on the first target.; Brute Force Breastplate over Queen's Wings when Use against sustained physical damage cores (Beatrix, Moskov, Karrie) where stacking defenses over a long fight beats a single burst window.; Immortality over Queen's Wings when Use in the late-game deciding fight where the revive is worth more than the mid-fight damage reduction.
- Total cost: 11070 gold

Default EXP-lane setup. War Axe into Hunter Strike spikes at minute 8-11, then Malefic Roar keeps the ult lethal past minute 12. Queen's Wings gives the anti-burst window to survive the first CC rotation. Blade of the Heptaseas synergizes with flanking approach vectors where you are out of combat until the moment you dash in.

### EXP Lane Anti-Physical (EXP)

- Items: Warrior Boots, War Axe, Hunter Strike, Blade of the Heptaseas, Malefic Roar, Brute Force Breastplate
- Core: War Axe, Hunter Strike, Blade of the Heptaseas
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Master Assassin, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Petrify
- Flex: Dominance Ice over Brute Force Breastplate when Use against lifesteal fighters (Freya, Zilong, Argus) where the Lifebane aura suppresses their sustain and Fortress Shield adds hybrid defense in close quarters.; Blade of Despair over Blade of the Heptaseas when Use when snowball is confirmed and the extra 160 Physical Attack plus Despair passive closes games.; Immortality over Brute Force Breastplate when Use as a late-game swap when one fight decides the match and the revive is the margin.
- Total cost: 10710 gold

Anti-physical setup for enemy comps stacking AD damage with minimal CC. Warrior Boots plus Brute Force Breastplate stacking gives scaling Physical Defense and movement speed that keeps Benedetta alive through extended trades where Queen's Wings would only trigger once.

### Jungle Assassin (Jungle)

- Items: Tough Boots, War Axe, Hunter Strike, Blade of the Heptaseas, Malefic Roar, Queen's Wings
- Core: War Axe, Hunter Strike, Blade of the Heptaseas
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Master Assassin, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Blade of Despair over Blade of the Heptaseas when Use when the game goes past minute 14 and you need the 160 Physical Attack to one-shot the enemy carry with a single Alecto rotation.; Immortality over Queen's Wings when Use in the final teamfight when the revive timer matters more than the mid-fight damage reduction.; Sea Halberd over Malefic Roar when Use against heavy sustain or shield comps (Rafaela, Estes, Angela, Esmeralda) where Lifebane is worth more than the penetration.
- Total cost: 11070 gold

Jungle Benedetta with Ice Retribution for the movement speed steal on ganks. The Heptaseas early buy lines up with the first rotation timing and gives Ambush proc on every flank. Queen's Wings provides the survive-the-engage layer since junglers have less CC peel than EXP-lane setups.

All builds for this hero: https://mlbbhub.com/builds/benedetta.

## Synergies

- Johnson: Benedetta works well with strong CC initiators, like Johnson and Gatotkaca, because they allow her to maximize the effects of her Ultimate.
